{
  "nl": "发货单管理：查询有发货单号、收货人；表格首列勾选，随后按「物流」分组表头展示承运商、运单号，另有发货单号、收货人列；支持新增、编辑、删除。",
  "nlEn": "Shipment management: query by shipment no. and consignee; the table has a leading checkbox column, then a \"Logistics\" group header covering carrier and tracking no., plus shipment no. and consignee columns; supports add, edit, and delete.",
